subject: feat(fallbacks): live drop indicator bar in Chain Flow drag-and-drop

- While dragging a chain chip, a vertical accent bar shows the exact slot
  where the chip will land; it slides live as the pointer moves (works across
  wrapped rows via reading-order comparison of live sibling rects)
- The drop uses the indicator-computed insert index, so the final order
  matches where the bar was
- rectSortingStrategy for wrap-correct layout math
- E2E verified: bar tracked 378px -> 181px during a sweep, drop reordered to
  the bar position and persisted; test env restored
- Debug findings: dnd-kit translated rect is content-relative inside scrolled
  containers; use initial rect + event.delta (viewport space) instead

